msgid "Specifying the configuration entry point as a string"
msgstr "指定配置入口点为字符串"

#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:0
msgid "Specifying the configuration entry point as a class"
msgstr "指定配置入口点为一个类"

#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:84
msgid ""
"The first code block is the preferred way to specify the configuration entry"
" point. The second code block is equivalent to the first one, but it leads "
"to import of the configuration class which slows down the import time. This "
"is why we recommend using strings for the configuration entry point."
msgstr ""
"第一个代码块是指定配置入口的首选方式。第二个代码块等同于第一个代码块，但会导致配置类的导入，从而减慢导入时间。这就是为什么我们建议使用字符串作为配置入口的原因。"

#: source/how-to/configuring_rl_training.rst:89
msgid ""
"The reinforcement learning entrypoints are configured by default to read the"
" ``<library_name>_cfg_entry_point`` from the ``kwargs`` dictionary to "
"retrieve the configuration instance."
msgstr ""
"强化学习入口默认从 ``kwargs`` 字典读取 ``<library_name>_cfg_entry_point`` ，以获取配置实例。"

